{"seq":3,"slug":"container-formats","title":"容器格式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mp4-mov","title":"MP4 与 MOV 容器格式","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/mp4-mov","wordCount":2072,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"mkv","title":"MKV 容器格式与 Matroska 生态","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/mkv","wordCount":2199,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"muxing-streams","title":"封装与流管理","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/muxing-streams","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 容器格式 简介\n\n容器格式（Container Format）是将编码后的视频流、音频流、字幕流和元数据\"封装\"为一个文件的格式规范。MP4、MKV、MOV 等容器各有设计哲学和适用场景。本章解析主流容器的结构、流（Stream）管理机制、以及格式选择策略。\n"}